# S momo-mobile — MASTER PROMPT & AI RULES

## Project Overview

Nama aplikasi: **Momo**
Platform: **Android Mobile App**
Framework: **Flutter (Latest Stable)**
Architecture: **Clean Architecture + Feature Based Modular Structure**
Target User: **Store Assistant / SPG / Fashion Store Staff**
Industry: **Fashion Retail / Department Store / Multi Brand Retail**

Aplikasi ini digunakan oleh store assistant untuk:

* Scan barcode fashion item
* Melihat detail produk secara cepat
* Melihat promo aktif
* Mengecek stock tersedia
* Melihat rekomendasi produk
* Membantu customer secara real-time
* Mendapat insight penjualan
* Mendapat AI recommendation untuk upselling
* Monitoring performa toko

---

# MASTER AI PROMPT

Gunakan prompt berikut untuk AI coding assistant seperti ChatGPT, Cursor AI, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, atau Devin.

---

# FLUTTER MASTER PROMPT

You are a world-class senior Flutter mobile architect and UI/UX engineer.

Build a professional enterprise-grade mobile application called "Sales Assistant App" for Android devices.

This app is used by fashion retail store assistants to scan products, view product information, check stock, see promotions, and assist customers in-store.

The application must follow these strict requirements:

## Tech Stack

* Flutter latest stable
* Dart latest stable
* Clean Architecture
* Feature-based folder structure
* Riverpod for state management
* GoRouter for routing
* Dio for API networking
* Freezed + Json Serializable
* Flutter Hooks
* Responsive UI
* Material 3
* Local storage using Hive
* Secure token using flutter_secure_storage
* Barcode scanner using mobile_scanner
* Infinite scroll & pagination support
* Dark mode support
* Offline-first capability
* Modular reusable components
* Internationalization ready
* Performance optimized
* Production-ready code

## Design Style

Design must look:

* Premium
* Enterprise-grade
* Modern retail dashboard
* Elegant black & gold accent
* Clean white minimalism
* Smooth rounded corners
* Soft shadow
* Luxury fashion retail aesthetic
* Similar quality to Shopify POS, Zara internal app, and Apple retail apps

## Main Theme

Primary Color:

* Gold #D89B3D
* Black #111111
* White #FFFFFF

Secondary:

* Soft Gray
* Warm Beige
* Luxury Gradient

Typography:

* Modern sans-serif
* Bold section headers
* Elegant spacing
* Minimal clutter

