## 3. Barcode Scan Feature

Design inspired by futuristic fashion scanner app.

### Scan Screen Requirements

Scanner page must include:

#### Camera Scanner Area

* Large camera preview
* Barcode overlay frame
* Smooth scan animation
* Gold scanning line
* Dark premium background

#### Scanner Controls

* Flash toggle
* History button
* Help button
* Scan mode switch

#### Product Detection

When barcode detected:

* Show bottom sheet result
* Product image
* Product name
* Product price
* Active promo
* Available sizes
* Stock status
* CTA button

#### Detail Poduk Page

Must contain:

* Large fashion image
* Product name
* SKU / article number
* Price
* Promo countdown
* Product information
* Available size chips
* Add to cart button
* Similar products button
* Favorite button

#### Promo Page

Show:

* Buy 2 Get 1
* Cashback
* Member discount
* Weekend special
* Top spender reward

Use luxury fashion visual style.

#### History Page

Show previous scan history with:

* Product image
* Scan timestamp
* Favorite toggle
* Quick reopen detail

#### Dark Mode

Create elegant black luxury mode.

