## Architecture Rules

Use this exact folder structure:

lib/
├── core/
│    ├── constants/
│    ├── theme/
│    ├── network/
│    ├── storage/
│    ├── widgets/
│    ├── utils/
│    ├── services/
│    └── extensions/
│
├── features/
│    ├── auth/
│    ├── dashboard/
│    ├── scanner/
│    ├── product/
│    ├── analytics/
│    ├── promotion/
│    ├── notification/
│    ├── ai_assistant/
│    └── profile/
│
├── shared/
│    ├── widgets/
│    ├── models/
│    └── components/
│
├── app/
│    ├── routes/
│    ├── providers/
│    └── app.dart
│
└── main.dart

---

## Coding Rules

Strict rules:

* No bad UI
* No messy code
* No gigantic widgets
* No duplicated logic
* No business logic inside widgets
* Use repository pattern
* Use immutable state
* Use const widget whenever possible
* Optimize rebuilds
* Avoid unnecessary packages
* Use proper naming conventions
* Use extension methods
* Create reusable design system
* Use loading skeleton
* Use graceful error handling
* Use responsive sizing
* Use modular widget composition

---

## Performance Rules

Must optimize for:

* Fast startup
* Low memory usage
* Smooth 60 FPS animation
* Minimal rebuilds
* Lazy loading
* Efficient API calls
* Smart image caching
* Pagination
* Offline cache

---

## AI Assistant Module

Include AI assistant features:

* Product recommendation
* Upselling suggestion
* Cross-selling recommendation
* Customer interaction help
* Smart response suggestion
* Store insight summary
* Stock recommendation
* Promotion recommendation

AI must be lightweight and token-efficient.

---

## UI Animation

Use subtle animations only:

* Fade transition
* Smooth bottom sheet
* Floating scan button
* Skeleton loading
* Smooth card hover
* Scan animation line

Avoid over-animation.

---

## Security Rules

* Secure token storage
* API interceptor
* Session expiration handling
* Request retry
* Secure environment config
* SSL-ready architecture

---

## Output Expectations

Generate:

* Complete production-ready Flutter code
* Reusable widgets
* Models
* Repositories
* API layer
* State management
* Navigation
* Theme system
* Dummy data
* Beautiful UI
* Clean architecture implementation

Never generate prototype-level code.
Everything must be scalable and enterprise-ready.

