# AI RULES FILE

Buat file berikut pada project:

```txt
.ai-rules
```

Isi file:

# AI RULES — SALES ASSISTANT APP

## CORE PRINCIPLES

1. Always prioritize clean architecture.
2. Always prioritize scalability.
3. Always prioritize maintainability.
4. Always prioritize performance.
5. Never generate messy code.
6. Never generate duplicated widgets.
7. Never place business logic inside UI.
8. Always use reusable widgets.
9. Always use strongly typed models.
10. Always optimize rebuild performance.

---

## FLUTTER RULES

* Use Flutter latest stable
* Use Riverpod
* Use GoRouter
* Use Dio
* Use Freezed
* Use Json Serializable
* Use Material 3
* Use feature-first architecture
* Use const constructors
* Use extension methods
* Use stateless widgets whenever possible
* Avoid StatefulWidget unless necessary

---

## UI RULES

* Use luxury fashion retail style
* Use rounded corners
* Use premium spacing
* Use minimal clutter
* Use elegant typography
* Use black and gold accents
* Use clean white backgrounds
* Maintain visual consistency

---

## COMPONENT RULES

* Maximum 200 lines per widget file
* Split large widgets into smaller widgets
* Create shared design system
* Create reusable cards
* Create reusable buttons
* Create reusable loaders
* Create reusable app bars

---

## PERFORMANCE RULES

* Minimize widget rebuilds
* Use pagination
* Use image caching
* Use lazy loading
* Use skeleton loading
* Use debounce search
* Cache API responses
* Avoid unnecessary API calls

---

## API RULES

* Use repository pattern
* Separate datasource layer
* Use DTO mapping
* Handle all exceptions
* Use interceptor
* Retry failed request safely
* Use typed responses

---

## TOKEN EFFICIENCY RULES

These rules are mandatory to reduce AI token usage.

1. Never regenerate unchanged files.
2. Only modify requested modules.
3. Reuse existing components.
4. Avoid generating long explanations.
5. Avoid unnecessary comments.
6. Use concise implementation.
7. Prefer reusable helper functions.
8. Avoid repeated imports.
9. Generate only relevant files.
10. Do not regenerate assets.
11. Do not regenerate models if unchanged.
12. Avoid verbose widget trees.
13. Use shared components.
14. Avoid unnecessary abstraction.
15. Prefer composition over duplication.

---

## AI RESPONSE RULES

When generating code:

* Focus only on requested feature.
* Return only changed files.
* Avoid reprinting full project.
* Avoid unnecessary markdown.
* Keep answers concise.
* Prioritize production code.
* Never create fake APIs.
* Never create fake architecture.
* Use realistic enterprise structure.

---

## SCANNER RULES

* Optimize camera performance
* Prevent duplicate scan trigger
* Use scan cooldown
* Handle low light mode
* Support barcode and QR
* Provide haptic feedback
* Use smooth scan overlay

---

## OFFLINE RULES

* Cache latest scans
* Cache latest products
* Queue failed requests
* Sync when online
* Use lightweight local database

---

## DESIGN SYSTEM RULES

* Maintain consistent spacing
* Maintain consistent icon size
* Maintain consistent typography
* Use shared color palette
* Use responsive sizing
* Avoid inconsistent layout

---

